{
  "name": "Share each new YouTube video on social media with Ampost",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Share each new YouTube video\nWhen your channel uploads a public video, Ampost posts its title and link to your other accounts.\n\n### Setup\n1. Install the **n8n-nodes-ampost** community node (Settings → Community nodes).\n2. Create an Ampost credential with an API key from ampost.io → Settings → API keys.\n3. In **New video**, replace `YOUR_CHANNEL_ID` with your channel ID (youtube.com → Settings → Advanced settings, starts with `UC`).\n4. Pick the platforms and edit the text in **Share the video**.\n5. Activate the workflow.\n\nYouTube updates the feed a few minutes after the video goes public.",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "125128f2-db0f-48e4-a8f5-d0483ead6bc3",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -480,
        -160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyHour"
            }
          ]
        },
        "feedUrl": "https://www.youtube.com/feeds/videos.xml?channel_id=YOUR_CHANNEL_ID"
      },
      "id": "f85a07cf-9375-48df-a917-4bf866f4031c",
      "name": "New video",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.rssFeedReadTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "platforms": [
          "bluesky",
          "threads"
        ],
        "text": "=New video: {{ $json.title }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "idempotencyKey": "=youtube-{{ ($json.id || $json.link).hash('sha256').slice(0, 40) }}",
          "linkUrl": "={{ $json.link }}"
        },
        "platformOptions": {}
      },
      "id": "de029aee-fe2d-46c6-a192-9a670cd81a4c",
      "name": "Share the video",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-ampost.ampost",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "ampostApi": {
          "id": "ampostApiCredential",
          "name": "Ampost account"
        }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "New video": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Share the video",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "pinData": {},
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false
  }
}
